      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra only ever wanted freedom and choice but instead she must rule a kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora had all the freedom and choice yet she only ever wanted to protect and serve.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;but maybe what you want, isnâ€™t what you need.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
